      description:
        "This recipe is for anyone who has a sweet tooth and loves a good crunch. Honey butter-flavored snacks are very popular in Korea, and if you make this with corn flakes, it’s very similar to a snack known as Honey Joys in Australia. Whether you’re enjoying this as a late night snack or decadent breakfast, it’s sure to satisfy any time of day.",
