              description:
                'We love bread — who doesn\'t? Toasts are our true loves, but we\'ve gotta keep it interesting. Luckily, we\'ve curated seven days worth of toasts to satisfy the toast-lover in you. Our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/sheet-pan-shakshuka-toast">sheet pan shakshuka toast</a> simplifies a flavorful classic while our flavorful, <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/nutella-marshmallow-french-toast">Nutella-marshmallow toast</a> gives you the sugar jolt you need to get your day going. Out of bread? The <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/bacon-eggs-sweet-potato-toast">Bacon and Eggs Sweet Potato Toast</a> is here to come to the rescue. Here\'s a toast to better mornings! ',
