              canonical_id: "compilation:2805",
              show: [
                {
                  name: "Tasty",
                  id: 17,
                },
              ],
              description:
                "Maybe you can't take a trip to Spain right now, but these recipes will help transport you there. Bring some Iberian sun into your own kitchen when you whip up this paella (all it requires is a cast iron skillet). Oh, and we've got a <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/spanish-omelet-tortilla-de-patata\">Spanish omelet</a> inspired by Madrid's tapas bars. Whether you're dreaming of Barcelona or the sparkling sea in Mallorca, these recipes will help satisfy your taste for Spain. ",
              language: "eng",
              id: 2805,
              slug: "recipes-that-will-transport-you-to-spain",
              buzz_id: null,
              promotion: "full",
