              canonical_id: "compilation:3189",
              id: 3189,
              beauty_url: null,
              aspect_ratio: "1:1",
              facebook_posts: [],
              description:
                'Eggs are honestly the best way to start your day. High in protein, easy to cook and with these 7 different kinds of omelets you can have the same smashing start to your day but with so many different flavors! The <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/spanish-omelet-tortilla-de-patata">Spanish omelet (aka Tortilla De Patata)</a> combines eggs with another classic breakfast food - potatoes. If you want to challenge yourself and have an extra few minutes on your hand, we recommend the <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/tamagoyaki-japanese-egg-omelet">Tamagoyaki</a>. And if you\'re having an extra busy AM, grab and go with this <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/bacon-spinach-omelet">bacon spinach omelet</a> in ajar. A spicier version is this <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/western-omelet">western omelet</a> - filled with cheese and veggies. Get those eggs cracking!',
              thumbnail_url:
                "https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/379415.jpg",
              name: "7 Days 7 Omelets",
